# Phase 7: Project Documentation

## Project Title

**LegalEase – AI-Powered Legal Document Generator**

## Project Overview

LegalEase is an AI-powered web application designed to help users generate structured legal document drafts using Generative AI.

The application allows users to enter document details and uses Google Gemini to generate a professional legal document draft.

## Project Objective

The main objective of LegalEase is to demonstrate how Generative AI can assist in creating structured legal document drafts from user-provided information.

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Streamlit
- FastAPI
- Google Gemini
- Pydantic
- Requests
- Python-dotenv
- Git
- GitHub
- Visual Studio Code

